### occurs_check — reproducer (T = [T])

#### detects the variable inside its own array element type

- Verify: detects the variable inside its own array element type
   - Expected: occurs_check(t, arr_of_t) is true


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: detects the variable inside its own array element type")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val t = fresh_var()
val arr_of_t = array_generic_type_register(t)
expect(occurs_check(t, arr_of_t)).to_equal(true)
```

</details>

#### makes unify_types reject the infinite type T = [T]

- Verify: makes unify_types reject the infinite type T = [T]
   - Expected: unify_types(t, arr_of_t) equals `UNIFY_FAIL_OCCURS`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: makes unify_types reject the infinite type T = [T]")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val t = fresh_var()
